sequenceDiagram
    participant T1 as Test class A
    participant T2 as Test class B
    participant T3 as Test class C
    participant Cache as Context cache (per JVM)
    T1->>Cache: config key K1?
    Cache-->>T1: miss, boot context (slow, seconds)
    T2->>Cache: config key K1?
    Cache-->>T2: hit, reuse (instant)
    T3->>Cache: key K2 (extra @MockitoBean)
    Cache-->>T3: miss, boot ANOTHER context
